{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1694822400, "end_date": 1695427199, "month_true_total": 97, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "146802839", "author": {"steamid": "76561198420563441", "personaname": "Narcissism's Finest", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DeadSupport/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2168, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1964, "last_played": 1700181004, "avatar": "dd3c3c2476ffb7b5464e91eee02f870d9a301132"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gem thats been promised community advice based updates/optimisations while the devs \"Build on the success\" of this game (Potentially for another) If you like Left4Dead and have 2 friends, this game is a blast. You can grab it off a key website for cheaper if its not on sale. You can get a key for like 7CAD at the current time I'm posting this.", "timestamp_created": 1695410440, "timestamp_updated": 1695410440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146782764", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800001978", "personaname": "MobyWi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/7656119880000197/", "num_games_owned": 100, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 28193, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 749, "playtime_at_review": 18016, "last_played": 1787691882, "avatar": "4fb2ddf1041da5132ac0bac57c7859f8725f1e14"}, "language": "english", "review": "Solide game for all the love the franchise and even the one that are new to it.\nThe Base game is very beginner friendly and 