o_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6733, "last_played": 1695691181, "avatar": "09b070b821b4edf0fbca143f0af92510d8db7696"}, "language": "english", "review": "An enjoyable and contained \"Horde-mode\" game, the higher the difficulty? The higher the challenge (and the more you'll want reliable or trusted pals. Best played with two friends.)\nIt has a satisfying and familiar loop, that you can enjoy re-playing again and again.\nThe weapons are varied and interesting, as each forces a different behavior and styles, alongside with the classes.\n(Small tip, though. Best handgun in the game: Type 95. VERY good fire-rate, ammo cap, and damage/accuracy.)\nP.S. NEVER use the \"Stuck Magazine\" card, when using the N79 EVA Laser. You LITERALLY end up screwed with being unable do anything. It doesn't \"Reload\" and will just end up leaving you a dead-weight for your team, able do nothing but be a meat-shield or support.", "timestamp_created": 1695280657, "timestamp_updated": 1695347817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146638192", "author": {"steamid": "76561199366678840", "personaname": "K_e4nu", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199366678840/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2468, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 699, "last_played": 1719479651, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1695205392, "timestamp_updated": 1695205392, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access":